    },
    {
      "id": "UW92KvWI2O2qQcSETCZGw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 365.60003662109375,
      "y": 551.1999931335449,
      "width": 1099.059326171875,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 616951836,
      "version": 447,
      "versionNonce": 1061436828,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "NZ7Ac8O1TY8WnqS4KIEss",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1781631022329,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What kind of latency interaction b/w server and database?\n        - What is latency? Time taken for a request. Total time for a request to be \ncompleted. It is the total travel time from client to server then server processing the server to client response.\n\n       ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What kind of latency interaction b/w server and database?\n        - What is latency? Time taken for a request. Total time for a request to be \ncompleted. It is the total travel time from client to server then server processing the server to client response.\n\n       ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZsRo2c6-DoCKbeunb5sbF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1165.6000366210938,
      "y": 337.3999900817871,
      "width": 234.43983459472656,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 807854748,
      "version": 95,
      "versionNonce": 2036287908,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781630800947,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Read Latency: 5-30ms\nWrite Latency: 10-40ms ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Read Latency: 5-30ms\nWrite Latency: 10-40ms ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4-na8otBPczfN7U1JmsUP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 359.60003662109375,
      "y": 707.1999931335449,
      "width": 899.9193115234375,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1640397860,
      "version": 364,
      "versionNonce": 1591061156,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781630955099,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What if ?\n  1. We have to optimise reads further, May be we want to achieve close to single digit ms.\n  2. We know some data is getting queried very frequently and doesn't change every second.\n \n  - In general disk lookups are expensive. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What if ?\n  1. We have to optimise reads further, May be we want to achieve close to single digit ms.\n  2. We know some data is getting queried very frequently and doesn't change every second.\n \n  - In general disk lookups are expensive. ",
