      "versionNonce": 54771612,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781631703091,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Cache is a faster storage layer generally places to improve read and write ops in \nbackend systems.\n- AWS -> Elastic cache -> Read latency < 5 - 10 ms (in same region expect <5ms)\n- Writes latency are also on the same number\n- Redis operates like in memory cache \n- Redis is also classified as the nosql database\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Cache is a faster storage layer generally places to improve read and write ops in \nbackend systems.\n- AWS -> Elastic cache -> Read latency < 5 - 10 ms (in same region expect <5ms)\n- Writes latency are also on the same number\n- Redis operates like in memory cache \n- Redis is also classified as the nosql database\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
