    {
      "id": "9O_hINRw5ilZrB8szbKTZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 537.6000366210938,
      "y": 1292.5999870300293,
      "width": 834.239501953125,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ad",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1718486172,
      "version": 571,
      "versionNonce": 2011382380,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781633616652,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Redis provides a complete infra of features.\n       - cache, queue, geo-spatial index, vectordb\n\n- in memory cache -> the data is stored in the RAM of redis servers. \n- feature -> Lua script in redis \n               Lua is a programming language and redis gives support to execute logical \n               scripts directly\n\n- TTL -> time to live, primary use case of ttl is locks \n\n      \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Redis provides a complete infra of features.\n       - cache, queue, geo-spatial index, vectordb\n\n- in memory cache -> the data is stored in the RAM of redis servers. \n- feature -> Lua script in redis \n               Lua is a programming language and redis gives support to execute logical \n               scripts directly\n\n- TTL -> time to live, primary use case of ttl is locks \n\n      \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
